# Copy to .env.local and fill in values once a real backend/provider exists.
# Nothing in this file is required for the current mock-only booking flow to run.

# --- Email (booking confirmation) ---------------------------------
# Used by a future server-side notification route (see lib/notifications).
# Must NEVER be read from client-side code.
# RESEND_API_KEY=

# --- SMS / WhatsApp (booking confirmation) -------------------------
# Provider not yet chosen — placeholder names only.
# NOTIFICATIONS_SMS_PROVIDER=
# NOTIFICATIONS_SMS_API_KEY=

# --- Payment (deposit charge) ---------------------------------------
# Not yet integrated — see lib/payment. Example for a future Toss Payments setup:
# TOSS_SECRET_KEY=
